WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:04.083
- Oh, Mahomes retired to play baseball? I’m just focused on getting my 20th ring.

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:07.958
- LAMAR! We have to go! We’re being eliminated by RYAN TANNEHILL—

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:12.083
- Ryan Tannehill tore his ACL three years ago. Man, we can beat the Titans in our sleep.

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:14.708
- Hey, man. Great job out there. You’re the future of our league. 

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:15.958
- [Together:] AHHHHHH.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.458
- Boo! Boo! Low Truzz! What happened?

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:20.958
- IT’S THE HAUNTING OF TANNEHILL HOUSE.

00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:27.333
- Oh, we’re about to have a fun vacation getaway, eh follow young stars?

00:00:27.666 --> 00:00:29.291
- Yeah, noted Canadian Chase Claypool.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.708
Wait, did we all wear letterman jackets? I thought I was the jock in this crew.

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:33.791
- [Together:] No, I'm the jock.

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:40.750
- They say the ghosts of all the injured QBs left for dead live there. 
But some of them find a way back. 

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:43.666
AHH! IT’S THE BENT-NECKED MANNING.

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:46.291
- [Nationwide tune] I created Adam Gase. 

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:50.125
- So you see...God damn it. When am I going to get the respect I—

00:00:50.166 --> 00:00:52.500
- You really think these oldheads can come back and haunt us?

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:54.750
- Yo, it wasn’t me. Broncos don’t play lights-out. 

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:57.000
- I’m sorry in advance. Turns out I’m good now!

00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:58.250
- [Together:] AHHHHHH.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:00.000
- OH NO...IT’S A TRAP...GAME. 

00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:04.291
- I'll take KFC sauce, and I like my extra crispy tenders boneless.

00:01:04.291 --> 00:01:05.375
- Not cool, man.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.125
- 100 percent white meat tenders, available now.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.458
- SOARIE ABOOT YOUR POOR AMERICAN HEALTHCARE THERE, RYAN.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.916
- DREW, LOCK THE DOOR.

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:12.791
- What about the door?

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:13.958
- [Together:] LOCK THE DOOR!

00:01:14.166 --> 00:01:14.875
- Oh.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.041
- Hello, prepare to be gone, baby. GONE.

00:01:24.041 --> 00:01:25.291
- Hey, I’d like this one actually.

00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:27.375
- Oh of course, Tyrod. You get whatever you want, man.

00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:31.083
- Don’t look in the mirror. Coach Gruden says mirrors 
are for rock stars and basketball players.

00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:33.000
- For some reason, you’re the only one here I can beat. 

00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:34.583
- I found the Red Zone, eh!

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:38.000
- I’m not like you guys. The Cowboys are gonna take me back.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.875
- Yeah, but do you want to go back?

00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:41.250
- Woah...I never thought of it like that.

00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:42.416
- Oh wait, it’s my turn.

00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:46.750
I’M COMING FOR YOU, BUT WATCH OUT BECAUSE
I’M SUPER CONFUSING.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:47.875
- Hello, Minkah.

00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:48.666
- You—

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.583
- Hold on. I’m not actually dead. I can come back from this. 

00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:54.791
- QUIET YOU, PEOPLE STILL SOMEWHAT RESPECT ME HERE IN 2018.

00:01:54.791 --> 00:01:55.916
- You might want to find a way out of here.

00:01:56.166 --> 00:01:59.208
- He was a victim of Gase, just like me. 

00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:00.625
- So many wasted years...

00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:03.458
- Woo! We're still undefeated. How weird is that?

00:02:03.458 --> 00:02:04.958
- Sure was nice to meet ya, ghost.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.833
- [Together:] TEAMY WANTS YOU TO SUBSCRIBE,

00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:12.083
But Teamy also wants…

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:13.541
a hug.

00:02:14.376 --> 00:02:17.208
Just because we be Team Monster

00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:20.504
don't mean we be monster monster.

00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:23.508
AHHHH MUST EAT TO SURVIVE!

